{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"saw","model_identifier":"saw","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"## saw\n\nWorker tool, metal tiers.\n\n- Cubes: 6 (0 rotated). Texture 64x32, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -0.8..0.8, y -5.5..2.5, z -21.0..2.0 (size 1.5 x 8.0 x 23.0 u = 4 x 22 x 65 cm).\nWide-blade hand saw (bronze, iron grades, steel), about 70 cm (25 u). Closed wooden D-grip at the origin, blade 4.5-21 u forward (-Z), tapering; toothed edge (alternating pixels) along the bottom (-Y). One-handed.\n- Embedded texture: bronze. Tier textures: bronze, iron_bloom, iron_wrought, iron_refined, steel, hq_steel.\n\n- Variant textures (same UV layout): `saw_bronze.png`, `saw_iron_bloom.png`, `saw_iron_wrought.png`, `saw_iron_refined.png`, `saw_steel.png`, `saw_hq_steel.png`\n"},"description":"## saw\n\nWorker tool, metal tiers.\n\n- Cubes: 6 (0 rotated). Texture 64x32, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -0.8..0.8, y -5.5..2.5, z -21.0..2.0 (size 1.5 x 8.0 x 23.0 u = 4 x 22 x 65 cm).\nWide-blade hand saw (bronze, iron grades, steel), about 70 cm (25 u). Closed wooden D-grip at the origin, blade 4.5-21 u forward (-Z), tapering; toothed edge (alternating pixels) along the bottom (-Y). One-handed.\n- Embedded texture: bronze. Tier textures: bronze, iron_bloom, iron_wrought, iron_refined, steel, hq_steel.\n\n- Variant textures (same UV layout): `saw_bronze.png`, `saw_iron_bloom.png`, `saw_iron_wrought.png`, `saw_iron_refined.png`, `saw_steel.png`, `saw_hq_steel.png`\n","resolution":{"width":64,"height":32},"elements":[{"name":"grip","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-0.75,-1.0,-1.5],"to":[0.75,1.0,2.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[32,10,33.5,12.0],"texture":0